===Vowels===
The use of doubled vowels in transcriptions suggest the existence of a contrast of [[vowel length|length]]. Very few words begin with a vowel, almost all of them being non-lexical grammatical words. The only vowels possible in initial position are {{IPA|/a i/}}.
